   "attributes": {
    "biography": {
     "en": "Im Dal-Young (Lim Dall-young, 임달영) is a South Korean author. He is best known for creating works such as Freezing and Unbalance Unbalance, as well as the founder of Artlim Media. \n\nRather infamously, he is also well-known for putting his series on indefinite hiatuses while deciding to start new works. Be wary of attachment to his series, since you’ll never know when they’ll end.  "
